  "observations": [
    "The 1759-line native adapter collection is split into loft, collocation, point-grid and trimming modules. Existing public reexports, 81 function bodies, shared interpolation ABI and NURBS payload are preserved. Only helper visibility and module wiring change.",
    "Fresh scalar queries retain coarse early-fraction and overshoot behavior. Degree elevation of the rational line through degrees 1, 2, 3 and 5 retains native parameters within 1e-12; degree alone does not explain the counterexamples.",
    "Always choosing the first qualifying overshoot checkpoint or prioritizing the trial endpoint regresses other native queries. Both experimental changes were rejected and the previous scalar algorithm was restored. The new ignored diagnostic remains explicitly failing. Its maximum combines parameter and coordinate differences in complete records.",
    "An independently proposed C1 reduction of the captured joined half fits has a complete 1e-6 positional bound against the native profile, despite larger-than-1e-8 control differences. A separate complete source-profile certificate is below half the requested 0.001 fit tolerance. This witness does not establish Rhino adaptive fitting or change Loft acceptance."
  ],
